WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes can fit into a busy day.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Zen12 sells guided and other short audio formats.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The seller says twelve minutes equals an hour of meditation.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
That equivalence has not been established by an independent Zen12 trial.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A review of binaural-beat EEG research found inconsistent results.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free routine. Check the sources before purchasing.
